<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse suspends Creditanstalt, EA-Generali.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse suspends Creditanstalt, EA-Generali.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna bourse on Friday said it had suspended trading in ordinary and preferred shares of Creditanstalt as well as in ordinary shares of insurer EA-Generali pending an important announcement.</p>
<p>EA-Generali leads a consortium of bidders for privatisation candidate Creditanstalt. A government deadline for a final bid by the group expires today.</p>
</text>
